    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/7ad34a7d843fffbcaabb98e82842bb7e.poster.avif?t=1740842074\" width=800 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/7ad34a7d843fffbcaabb98e82842bb7e.webm?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/7ad34a7d843fffbcaabb98e82842bb7e.mp4?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you want your inn to look? Build walls, wallpaper, and decorate rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/91a56585ca7592920fcce9f719c880ae.poster.avif?t=1740842074\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/91a56585ca7592920fcce9f719c880ae.webm?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/91a56585ca7592920fcce9f719c880ae.mp4?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assign a room to a guest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests have their own preferences. Give your guests the rooms they prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/4a154d59edc5e6f62d58e6dc6a4aa977.poster.avif?t=1740842074\" width=800 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/4a154d59edc5e6f62d58e6dc6a4aa977.webm?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/4a154d59edc5e6f62d58e6dc6a4aa977.mp4?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hang out with your guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fishing, exercising, hunting, foraging, and more with your guests. Enjoy a tranquil walk in the woods together or throw a party to liven things up. Your guests will cherish the memories more than anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monster guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting, fishing, and walking with guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your inn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of furniture, decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay ratings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking and recipes</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/7ad34a7d843fffbcaabb98e82842bb7e.poster.avif?t=1740842074\" width=800 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/7ad34a7d843fffbcaabb98e82842bb7e.webm?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/7ad34a7d843fffbcaabb98e82842bb7e.mp4?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you want your inn to look? Build walls, wallpaper, and decorate rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/91a56585ca7592920fcce9f719c880ae.poster.avif?t=1740842074\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/91a56585ca7592920fcce9f719c880ae.webm?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/91a56585ca7592920fcce9f719c880ae.mp4?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assign a room to a guest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests have their own preferences. Give your guests the rooms they prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/4a154d59edc5e6f62d58e6dc6a4aa977.poster.avif?t=1740842074\" width=800 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/4a154d59edc5e6f62d58e6dc6a4aa977.webm?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/4a154d59edc5e6f62d58e6dc6a4aa977.mp4?t=1740842074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hang out with your guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fishing, exercising, hunting, foraging, and more with your guests. Enjoy a tranquil walk in the woods together or throw a party to liven things up. Your guests will cherish the memories more than anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monster guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting, fishing, and walking with guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your inn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of furniture, decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay ratings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking and recipes</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Manage a monster-friendly inn. Every day, a new monster guest visits. Chop down trees to make furniture and decorate the rooms. You'll need to catch fish, hunt, and prepare meals. Satisfied guests will return to your inn next time.",
